  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b954ab6b0c9ad417294211e10b342a2ec2bc6917.webp\" alt=\"banner with a wind chimes icon and the text &quot;wind chimes&quot;\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本模組是原始公共領域<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwindchimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">風鈴模組</a>的忠實延續，原作者為<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhibi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hibi</a>。</p>\n<p>本專案的目標是在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 平台上，將原模組的內容更新以支援現代的 Minecraft 版本。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d3652541655d5a51e1c73d2ba12060945b5f6c3d.png\" alt=\"拾取線材以解鎖所有配方\"></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:959px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rWKBhm5CV1g?si=4de1KMWHPU4AKAL8&controls=0\" width=\"765\" height=\"586\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
